roved-for-explicit-split-models"},{"key":"review_priority","html":"P1"},{"key":"review_note_id","html":"J05"},{"key":"review_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-for-explicit-split-models"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-19"},{"key":"source","html":"§11.5–§11.6; local proof for the explicit split two-sort model presentation"},{"key":"current_review_boundary","html":"Explicit split two-sort models; no assertion about coherence or completeness for ordinary generic models"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"thm-fhodtt-completeness-—-严格版本兼容入口\">thm-fhodtt-completeness — 严格版本兼容入口</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}\">\\(\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}\\)</span>，演算、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Expr}\">\\(\\mathsf{Expr}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\">\\(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}\">\\(\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"32520a37e4beb365\" href=\"?note=32520a37e4beb365\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness\">16-thm-fhodtt-completeness</a> 的同一已定义接口。模型量词范围包含该页的显式句法商模型。</li>\n<li>正向采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7b655ef4974b8266\" href=\"?note=7b655ef4974b8266\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness\">16-thm-fhodtt-soundness</a> 的规则归纳；反向采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"32520a37e4beb365\" href=\"?note=32520a37e4beb365\" title=\"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness\">16-thm-fhodtt-completeness</a> 的句法模型反射。此处不预设任一方向为模型公理。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ \\Gamma\\vdash e:A\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl[(\\forall S)\\bigl(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longrightarrow\nS\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\bigr)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ \\Gamma\\vdash e:A\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl[(\\forall S)\\bigl(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longrightarrow\nS\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\bigr)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>历史双向入口同步到已明确定义的严格版本。两方向分别使用独立的结构公理/规则归纳与具体句法商见证；没有增加普通 generic 的同构分类唯一性假设，也没有把未定义的模型解释记号保留在断言中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"thm-fhodtt-completeness-—-严格版本兼容入口","text":"thm-fhodtt-completeness — 严格版本兼容入口","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}$，演算、$\\mathsf{Expr}$、$\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}$ 与 $\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}$ 采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 的同一已定义接口。模型量词范围包含该页的显式句法商模型。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"7b655ef4974b8266","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"正向采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]] 的规则归纳；反向采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 的句法模型反射。此处不预设任一方向为模型公理。","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-fhodtt-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"32520a37e4beb365","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"正向采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-soundness]] 的规则归纳；反向采用 [[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness]] 的句法模型反射。此处不预设任一方向为模型公理。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Gamma\\vdash A:\\mathsf{Type}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Expr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}","display":false},{"tex":"\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl[(\\exists e\\in\\mathsf{Expr})\\ \\Gamma\\vdash e:A\\bigr]\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigl[(\\forall S)\\bigl(\\mathrm{SplitFHoDTTModel}(S)\\Longrightarrow\nS\\models^{\\mathrm{spl}}_\\Gamma A\\bigr)\\bigr].","display":true}],"bytes":1800,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-420","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-fhodtt-completeness-compat|thm-fhodtt-completeness — Compatibility statement]]"}],"outgoing":["32520a37e4beb365","7b655ef4974b8266"]}